      "url": "https://api.example.com",
      "status_code": 200,
      "latency_ms": 184.21,
      "healthy": true,
      "error": null
    }
  ]
}
```

## Why PulseForge?

PulseForge is intentionally small, dependency-light, and automation-friendly.

It can be used as:

* An API monitoring utility
* A lightweight uptime checker
* A CI/CD health gate
* A debugging tool for distributed services
* A foundation for a larger observability platform

